Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.60,0:00:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think we quite finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.32,0:00:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You've brought up some important things, so promise to keep in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.30,0:00:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I suggest you come to my practice again soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.30,0:00:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got things to do now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'll go back to my practice when I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.40,0:00:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop by.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.70,0:00:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. See you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.58,0:00:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm by the square in Uptown. The blue house on the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.88,0:00:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,In case you'd forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.26,0:00:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye for now.
